# AI Translated
#. TRN Warning shown in Preferences before "Enable Bambu Cloud" or "Enable Bambu network plug-in" is turned on.
msgid ""
"This module has not been verified by Cosmyx and relies on machines the "
"Cosmyx team does not support. Use it at your own risk."
msgstr ""
"Dieses Modul wurde nicht von Cosmyx geprüft und setzt Maschinen voraus, die "
"das Cosmyx-Team nicht unterstützt. Die Nutzung erfolgt auf eigene Gefahr."

# AI Translated
# Needs human review: used as both a warning caption and a Preferences section title; check 'Maschinen' vs 'Drucker' fits the section
#. TRN Caption of the warning, named after the Preferences section holding the two toggles.
#. TRN Title of the Preferences section holding the Bambu Cloud and Bambu network plug-in toggles.
msgid "External machines"
msgstr "Externe Maschinen"
